{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":18083912,"ns":0,"title":"Conductor pipe","extract":"A conductor pipe is a large diameter pipe that is set into the ground to provide the initial stable structural foundation for a borehole or oil well.\nIt is the first string of casing, and of the largest diameter installed into a well.","description":"Oil well and borehole component","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}